# The Rescue Drill (San d'Oria 2-1), Grilau's route, Galaihaurat's sword and a repeat. A level 10 Warrior of San d'Oria,
# rank 2 with 1-1, 1-2 and 1-3 completed. Section 1: Grilau's script plays 1009; its finish with option 3 begins the
# mission (Northern San d'Oria's 1009). Section 2, status 0: Grilau plays ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 36. La Theine
# Plateau, status 8 with the Option var 1 (GMs): Equesobillot and Deaufrain answer RESCUE_DRILL + 21; Galaihaurat plays
# 114: the Bronze Sword, status 9. Status 9: Galaihaurat answers +25, Deaufrain and Equesobillot +26. Ordelles Caves:
# the sword traded: 2, status 10. Grilau at status 10: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 36; Vicorpasse 115, status 11; Grilau
# at status 11: 1005, whose finish completes the mission. Repeated (begun again by the same 1009 finish; section 1 has
# no completed check): Ruillont at status 0 answers RUILLONT_INITIAL_DIALOG + 9 (completed), and at status 8 his default
# 7372 plays first, then + 9; Galaihaurat at status 0 plays 110 (section 2), then at status 2 answers RESCUE_DRILL + 16.
# Rival zone-in, another mission's script: the login in Northern San d'Oria plays Seekers of Adventure's Rumors from the
# West onZoneIn, which returns 878 (the trace records only that return, with no event packet).
lists NorthernSanDoria/Grilau/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1009 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1005 LaTheinePlateau/Deaufrain/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/Equesobillot/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/Galaihaurat/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/Vicorpasse/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/114 LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/115 OrdellesCaves/Ruillont/onTrigger OrdellesCaves/Ruillont/onTrade OrdellesCaves/onEventFinish/2
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=-240.5,7,57.9 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren completed
rank 2
login
trigger Grilau                          # section 1: his script's 1009
finish option=3                         # begun
trigger Grilau                          # section 2, status 0: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 36
warp -482,-7,222 LaTheinePlateau
missionstatus Sandoria 8                # a GM
charvar Mission[0][3]Option 1           # a GM
trigger Equesobillot                    # Option 1, not 2: RESCUE_DRILL + 21
trigger Deaufrain                       # Option 1, not 3: RESCUE_DRILL + 21
trigger Galaihaurat                     # Option 1: 114
finish                                  # the Bronze Sword, status 9
trigger Galaihaurat                     # status 9, Option 1: RESCUE_DRILL + 25
trigger Deaufrain                       # RESCUE_DRILL + 26
trigger Equesobillot                    # RESCUE_DRILL + 26
warp -70,1,607 OrdellesCaves
walk -71,1,607
trade Ruillont BronzeSword x1           # status 9: 2
finish                                  # status 10
warp -240.5,7,57.9 NorthernSanDoria
trigger Grilau                          # status 10: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 36
warp -344,37,266 LaTheinePlateau
trigger Vicorpasse                      # status 10: 115
finish                                  # status 11
warp -240.5,7,57.9 NorthernSanDoria
trigger Grilau                          # status 11: 1005
finish                                  # completed (300 rank points)
trigger Grilau                          # section 1: 1009 (no completed check)
finish option=3                         # begun again
warp -70,1,607 OrdellesCaves
trigger Ruillont                        # status 0, completed: RUILLONT_INITIAL_DIALOG + 9
missionstatus Sandoria 8                # a GM
trigger Ruillont                        # status 8, completed: his default 7372, then RUILLONT_INITIAL_DIALOG + 9
warp -482,-7,222 LaTheinePlateau
missionstatus Sandoria 0                # a GM
trigger Galaihaurat                     # sections 2 and 3: 110
finish                                  # status 2
trigger Galaihaurat                     # status 2: RESCUE_DRILL + 16
